	main = "It's snowing pretty hard outside. Commander, want a nice warm cup of cider before you head out?|Hobby is so cute, isn't she? I'd love to be as outgoing as her.|It's really cold outside, Commander, so you should take care to stay warm. Here, I poured your cider into hot sauce so it will keep you warm better~",
