	drop_descrip = "Hm? I'm just wrapping up some presents! Can't just present them as-is, and all that. Hehe~ I could sure use a little help, Commander!",
	feeling4 = "",
	lose = "",
	feeling1 = "",
	skill = "",
	upgrade = "",
	propose = "",
	feeling5 = "",
	main = "You'd be surprised how easy wrapping presents is! You just put it like this... take some wrapping paper... then a ribbon... aaand done!|Man, I wish I could ride anywhere in a cool snowmobile like Minneapolis. \"It's too dangerous for a kid to ride\"? Hey! It's not like I'm a little baby or anything!|I'm getting kinda bored... Hey, Commander, wanna play word association? With a Christmas theme, obviously!",
