	main = "Meowfficer plushes, Manjuu hand puppets... I never realized how much weird stuff I've amassed over the years.|I invited Laffey over, thinking she'd be fun to chill with. Turns out she's just a sleep junkie, like Nicholas. |Yeah, the place is a mess, but I'm used to it. It's way too much work to tidy up, so let's not.",
