	feeling1 = "",
	skill = "",
	upgrade = "",
	propose = "",
	feeling5 = "",
	main = "Fluffy fluffy, moe moe, meooow~... Is this spell really supposed to make food taste better? Sounds too easy to me... Hey, don't scarf it down! Was it actually good...?|These shoes are just for the job. I definitely didn't get them so I could bring you your orders faster... Whoa?! I'm gonna fall – oww! H-hurry up and help me... Hey, watch where you're putting those hands!|Apologies for the wait, Master. Here's the \"Hammann Feeds You with Love Special\"... Wh-who the hell put that on the menu?!",
