	main = "I wanted to sit on my rigging and fly directly to the academy, but that wouldn't work, so I ended up walking. I wish I could ride instead of walk...|When Laffey needs to remember something, I can just type it into my display panel... So convenient.|Does Laffey look stronger now? ...Because I can sleep sitting on my rigging? No? Hmm...|This new cargo space is great... All of my favorite drinks are in there... Here. This one's cold, so you can have it...|Don't worry about Laffey... Even when I'm asleep, I'm plenty alert... Yep...",
