	feeling4 = "",
	lose = "",
	feeling1 = "",
	skill = "",
	upgrade = "",
	propose = "",
	feeling5 = "Hmm... seems it'll keep snowing for a while. Why don't you stay for the night, Commander? ...Oh? I was thinking we could share some drinks, but perhaps you had something else in mind? Ahahah♡",
	main = "A \"hatsumode,\" huh... Do you have any wishes to make, Commander? It so happens I don't, so you can have my wish.|Not to say the Eagle Union's new year celebrations are lonesome, but the Sakura Empire's and Dragon Empery definitely celebrate New Year's with more festivity. And I like festivities.|Oh, Commander, if you're hoping to get me drunk... well, it depends on how much you yourself can drink. Ahahah~",
