	skill = "",
	upgrade = "",
	propose = "",
	feeling5 = "",
	main = "I wonder if I should give Quincy something... Hey Commander, do you think she'd be happy to get some grilled fish?|Commander, I'd like to take you for a drive in this machine, but it's designed for only one passenger... Hey, do you want to try sitting in the luggage compartment?|This guy over here has some nice horsepower, but riding and controlling it is a bit rough. I'm grateful to Jamaica for all her help.",
