	skill = "",
	upgrade = "",
	propose = "",
	feeling5 = "Commander, I hear the Dragon Empery's new year celebration is a day to be with family. So, umm... Does that mean you can stay here with me?",
	main = "Commander, umm... Do you want to lie down next to me? Let your heart be calm... \"Free from worldly cares\"? Is that what they call being comfy and cozy here?|As long as I'm with you, I feel relaxed... um, no matter where we are.|I'm used to things being noisy, but being alone... It's nice. Right?",
