	main = "You know, Long Island the ghost has become boring... Now, I am Long Island the Jiangshi, jumping zombie!|Ehehe~ Commander, are you looking for your gaming handheld?|Com~man~der~! Huh? You really fell asleep? Hehehe~ What kind of pranks should I pull?",
