	feeling5 = "",
	main = "A weapon may be powerful, but if it can't be used properly, it won't be completely effective. It is the teacher's job to teach you how to use them! Physical education? I-I'll teach that again!|I've only improved a few times before, and they were just small enhancements. Now that everyone is stronger, I can start getting some work done.|Commander? I believe in you, so I'm letting you study on your own while I work on my planes. I'll get angry if you avoid your study this time, alright?",
