	skill = "For the sake of freedom...!",
	upgrade = "Thanks...",
	propose = "I had fallen into the darkness. It was you, Commander who gave me light and a helping hand which pulled me out of it. That's why this time, I, Yorktown, will give you my name. The name that shoulders the burden of liberty and peace...",
