	mission = "We still have missions that haven't been completed. You should check on their progress.",
	vote = "",
	drop_descrip = "There is no doubt in my mind that I was born to fight. For the azure lanes of liberty, Enterprise, engaging!",
	feeling4 = "",
	lose = "So I've... overstepped my limits...?",
	feeling1 = "",
	skill = "",
	upgrade = "",
	propose = "",
	feeling5 = "",
	main = "I'm quite impressed by the Royal Maids. Aside from their combat prowess, they're also very good at a wide variety of other things. |Vestal, what's the matter? ...No, I've been making sure to eat! Commander has been making all sorts... I mean, I cook from time to time as well! |My eagle is quite attached to you, Commander. We should all get along just like you two. Hehe.",
