	drop_descrip = "Hmm... Isn't this one a bit too garish? Mm... What if we pair it with a necklace or some sort of purse? ...Commander, your thoughts? C'mon, don't just stare at me, give me something to work with here...",
	feeling4 = "",
	lose = "",
	feeling1 = "",
	skill = "",
	upgrade = "",
	propose = "",
	feeling5 = "",
	main = "I also chose a getup for my partner here... Hehe, doesn't it give off \"gentlemanly\" vibes?|Ahaha, seems like this store also sells wigs. Commander, want to try some on?|Makeup? Uh, I'm not well-versed in that stuff, so I guess I'll pick up a little bit of everything. I'll try asking around for help after we get back!",
