	main = "Calling your horse back just by whistling? That's cheating! But I'm a woman of my word, so now we're gonna travel together.|I'll bet your back hurts after riding your horse for so long. Want me to give ya a massage? C'mon, don't be shy!|Oh, you've got dust on your face. Lemme wipe it off with my handkerch– W-wait a sec, why'd you ask me where I got it from, what the heck?!|*cough cough*... Y'know, that smoke grenade I just threw to get away... it was actually a modified herring can. Anyway, herring saved the day and let you get out unscathed!",
