	main = "Don't I look better than Dandy Siego with this fit on? Ahah☆|Whoa... This bunny idol thing is popping off! I need to thank Laffey for the idea later!|\"Where are you looking? I'm right over here~\" Ahahah! Stop looking away, Commander~|Cameramanjuu crew, remember to get some shots of the audience, too! Don't you try to hide, Commander!|(Crap! Jumping up here is pretty dangerous... But with the Commander watching, maybe it's worth the risk?)",
