	propose = "",
	feeling5 = "Don't worry. Even if you belong to everyone else, Commander, Aurora belongs only to you. Hehe, this way, the other girls won't come to resent you~",
	main = "I've adorned your office with more than just roses... Azaleas, peonies, cyclamen, carnations... Is it not better to foster a warm and harmonious atmosphere?|Elegance, grace, and strength of spirit... I must work harder in order to become your supporting pillar.|A lively festival can be quite enjoyable, but there's also value in relaxing in a spacious room.",
