	feeling1 = "",
	skill = "",
	upgrade = "",
	propose = "",
	feeling5 = "I once thought myself a traveler, with nothing to tie me down, with no real destination... Turns out I was wrong, Boss. I'll always come back to you, no matter what happens.",
	main = "This baby's got more horsepower than the other one, even if it's less reliable. She's still a good bike.|Worried about your hair? Well, safety's the most important thing on the road, so you'd better hang on to this helmet.|Boss, would you like to learn about motorcycles? I thought you might. Let's begin with starting the engine. First...",
