	lose = "",
	feeling1 = "",
	skill = "",
	upgrade = "",
	propose = "",
	feeling5 = "",
	main = "The sea is a tempestuous battlefield, and yet the beach is a relaxing Eden. What an incredible duality.|Beach volleyball? I've heard it's quite fun. Do you think I could give it a try?|The sand is so soft, so fine. It feels so pleasant between my toes...",
