	feeling1 = "",
	skill = "",
	upgrade = "",
	propose = "",
	feeling5 = "Your exam came back... with superb results! Heehee, of course, I expected that all along. The reason I called you here was because I wanted an excuse to make you rest, even if it was just for ten minutes... That's all!",
	main = "These instruments are made of silver, while these are titanium alloy, and the others are diamond-studded – Oh, of course... They're only for collection purposes. Pretty though they are, they can't be used for exams.|Did you know? Your teeth affect people's impressions of you. You can hold back words, but you can't hide the traces of your lifestyle habits.|Commander, do you remember our last etiquette lesson? Hehe, it's time to put it into practice... What will you say to me when my clothing is in such disarray?",
