	feeling1 = "",
	skill = "",
	upgrade = "",
	propose = "",
	feeling5 = "",
	main = "People aren't changing into swimsuits just for your viewing pleasure... Got it? |You should watch yourself around Shropshire. That girl develops a variety of... how should I say this? ...Bad habits during the summer? |Hm? It's nothing. When we're at the beach, you can do whatever you want. *sigh*... It's just that... looking at your mug makes me really uneasy for some reason...",
