	main = "My Swordfish squadrons are in tip-top condition today! Likewise for my Fulmar squadrons!|It is customarily destroyers that protect carriers, but there's nothing wrong with reversing that. Don't you agree?|To protect what's close to you, you must always keep a watchful eye on the horizon. I trust you to do that, Commander.",
