	lose = "",
	feeling1 = "",
	skill = "",
	upgrade = "",
	propose = "",
	feeling5 = "",
	main = "All these Iris flowers are not just for showy decoration, they make for some aromatherapy as well. Hehe.|These Dragon Empery decorations all have a certain... unique charm to them, don't they?|Commander, you absolutely must try the Empyreal cuisine the Royal Maids prepared. I've heard even Her Majesty praised the flavour. Hehehe.",
