	feeling1 = "",
	skill = "",
	upgrade = "",
	propose = "",
	feeling5 = "I heard forming a party with people you have high affection with makes your stats go up... And if it goes even higher, you get to... I-I'll do my best to raise our stats!",
	main = "Why does this staff have the Charm skill, anyway... What if I used it on... N-never mind! I-I shouldn't think of such things...|Raising your weapon's level can lead to stronger healing effects... Huh? Z23, you think I shouldn't...?|Huh? You can level up just by leaving the character over there and go AFK...? Laffey, your knowledge is incredible...",
