	main = "Maybe I should also bring some hay along with the carrots... No, Fubuki! You can't feed that stuff to a bunny!|I guess the ears really are the first thing people go for when they see a bunny... No, I'm talking about bunnies, not me!|Oh, to be a happy rabbit, spending my days eating, sleeping, and playing with humans...",
