	skill = "",
	upgrade = "This power... is for the sake of protecting my friends...!",
	propose = "",
	feeling5 = "",
	main = "Those Cloak of Invisibility things that they have in the Royal Navy are really cool... they make me a bit jealous... |When I need help, I usually turn to Shouhou or Zed. As for Fubuki... she always hears me out on a variety of stuff. I'm very thankful. |This cloak that Yuubari developed for me... has a function that \"always conceals its wearer's face.\" That's... probably good. |Commander's office is always protected, and it is absolutely safe. There's no need to worry.",
