	main = "I've brought a bunch of mouth-watering strawberries! Commander, wanna try one?|We thought Akatsuki had gotten lost again, but Hibiki seems to have bumped into her. I see, I see, so that's what we call a \"random encounter!\"|Don't you think this tooty manjuu is a bit annoying? ...You don't even see it, Commander?",
