	main = "Oh yeah, whaddya want for Christmas, Commander? I can get it for ya, even if it takes some lookin' 'round.|Christmas is more fun when ya get everyone together 'n throw a big party~|By the end of the year, everyone'll be smilin'~♪ Hehe, it makes me happy, too~",
