	skill = "",
	upgrade = "",
	propose = "",
	feeling5 = "Hm...? I've might've fallen for ya again, Commander... You look even more charmin' than usual... What about me? Ya think I'm cuter than usual?",
	main = "Albacore, don't go causin' mischief durin' the party, all right? Commander, I reckon you oughta tell her too.|Michishio 'n Arashio almost love Asashio as much as I do~ That's why we all love havin' tea parties with her. You too, Commander, go become buddy buds with her~|Commander, it ain't nice of ya to check out other girls while yer talkin' to me~! Where are yer manners?",
