	main = "Sparklers might not be as gorgeous as the fireworks that blossom in the sky, but it's nice to be able to have something you can enjoy at your own pace.|Asashio, will you be able to remember this place? Try not to get lost, okay?|It's so quiet along the river bank... You can even hear the soft crackling of fireworks.",
