	feeling5 = "Commander, when I'm with you it feels like I'm a fish in water, a bee that found honey, a ticking time bomb of joy that goes BOOOOM! ...Something in that ballpark, basically.",
	main = "Uranami rhymes with rural mommy. Doodle-loo, nothing better to dooo.|Help friends in need, defeat enemies with speed. That's my little motto.|When I tell folks about the things I like, they all look super weirded out, then they strangerzone me. But oh well.",
