	skill = "",
	upgrade = "",
	propose = "",
	feeling5 = "",
	main = "Look, Commander, that coral reef... Hehehe, the \"flowers\" in the sea are quite beautiful as well, aren't they? |This swimsuit... took a lot of agonizing over, but I eventually made my decision... Commander, what do you think? Does it look good on me? |Gah...! ...Ah, s-sorry! I was just looking at the ocean... and suddenly shifted into anti-submarine mode... I know I shouldn't be so uptight during time off!",
