	feeling4 = "",
	lose = "",
	feeling1 = "",
	skill = "",
	upgrade = "",
	propose = "",
	feeling5 = "You just can't help how much you love me, I know. You can't blame me for wanting to tease you, though! So, are you gonna even the score? Don't you wanna teeease your beloved Hatsuzuki? Be my guest♡ Heehee!",
	main = "You're the one who said anything I like is fine, so it's too late to take it back now! Besides, you look like you wanna find out how it tastes... Don't play so hard to get!|You're bound to get thirsty sooner or later after chatting with me for so long. Heheh. Hope you're grateful for how forward-thinking I am♪|Now look, I'm going to pour it riiight– Eek! Y-you don't want the carpet to get dirty? Huh? Come again?",
