	skill = "I... I'm not afraid anymore!",
	upgrade = "",
	propose = "",
	feeling5 = "",
	main = "Y-you saw something weird?! Wh-wh-where?! ...Jeez! Don't scare me like that! |Nagara said that I looked cuter before, but I think that's just because she likes to dote on me...!|Kinu seems like the dependable type, but she sometimes gives off really scary vibes... Ugh, I just don't understand her.",
