	feeling4 = "",
	lose = "",
	feeling1 = "",
	skill = "",
	upgrade = "",
	propose = "",
	feeling5 = "Isn't it easier to tell someone how much you love, love, love them when you're alone together? Ehehe, of course it is~ You've been trying to say it for a while now, right, Commander? I'll let you go first. Say it loud enough for me to hear, now♪",
	main = "Whoa! Commander, you're soaked. Oh, I know; were you and Noshiro shooting water guns? Ahaha!♪ She never holds back when it comes to play.|Swimsuits aren't just for the beach. They work great for swimming in rivers, too. Hm? You aren't going to swim, Commander?|There's going to be a big fireworks show later, right? I'll save room for the feast later♪",
