	propose = "",
	feeling5 = "",
	main = "Commander, even if you're at school, you can't slack off too much! |What clubs am I interested in joining... I wonder if there's a kendo club... |This uniform was supposed to fit, so why is it so tight... C-Commander?! What are you staring at!?",
