	feeling1 = "",
	skill = "",
	upgrade = "",
	propose = "",
	feeling5 = "",
	main = "The flashes from the camera are a bit too bright, but worry not about me. Commander, I shall face down each and every challenge before me. |I should try to maintain my smile at times like these? If you say so... then I shall do as you advised to the utmost of my ability. |Commander, would you mind holding onto my parasol for a bit? I need to fix my hair accessory...",
