	main = "Umm... So if I stay still and don't touch the tripwire beams, you'll let me go? H-how much longer must I wait, then?!|(Phew... I'm a little tired. Who knew this scene would be so demanding? And this pose... Oof.)|All of the cameras are pointing at me... Does that mean I'm being observed from all angles?! O-oh, no! It's too embarrassing... Isn't one camera enough?",
