	main = "I think Hiei used to paint... I should ask her for some good drawing tips.|These ones I'm painting now are for my sisters. Do you wanna tag along with me when I hand them over later?|Dang, I'm almost out of ink... Do you reckon Akashi sells ink at her store?",
