	skill = "",
	upgrade = "",
	propose = "",
	feeling5 = "",
	main = "Commander, if it begins to snow, please take cover under my umbrella~ |Perhaps I should return the favor and make something for Yamashiro to wear... Commander, what kind of outfit do you think is best? |The happiness we can enjoy right now is surely a blessing from the gods... No, it's because of your hard work, Commander.",
