	feeling5 = "",
	main = "Hmm, beach volleyball? ... I'll use my powers to turn Saratoga into a holey woman! Ain't that right, Chitose?|The summer sun, the sparkling sea... Stop lazing around and come play with me already, Chitose~|Oh, Yamashiro and her sister came too. Wouldn't it be a good idea to team up with them? Well?",
