	main = "Strasser gave me an envelope with cash inside! She said it's a Sakura Empire and Dragon Empery tradition! Commander, you gimme one too~|Let's crank it up to eleven for New Year's! Even Spee's out there having fun with the gang!|Can't we leave all the office work for later and get dressed for a snowball fight? I promised Lebe I'd come!",
