	skill = "",
	upgrade = "",
	propose = "",
	feeling5 = "",
	main = "Even though we've toasted over so many drinks already, I can't believe that you're still so lively. I might have underestimated you a bit, Commander.|As my lovely knight in shining armor, Commander, don't you think you should be asking your princess for a dance?|The girls of the Iron Blood are calling for me. Come greet them with me, Commander.",
