	drop_descrip = "So the Second Movement is a Lento of the summer and the sea? So be it... Since we will arrive at the Finale eventually, I suppose I can enjoy this moment of fleeting peace with you.",
	feeling4 = "",
	lose = "",
	feeling1 = "",
	skill = "",
	upgrade = "",
	propose = "",
	feeling5 = "",
	main = "Is there a nice vantage point on the beach to sit at? ...There isn't? Oh well... |I only wore this... \"clothing\" because you told me to. If you didn't come to the beach with me, I'd be... rather upset. |Eugen, don't rush me, the commander is still working. What am I going to do on the beach by myself...",
