	main = "Hey, Z28! Stop treating the Meowfficers like pets! Look, I know they seem like pets in more ways than one!|Javelin and her friends aren't too keen about coffee. Heh, that proves that they're still just kids.|So that's where you're hiding! Gotcha! ...What? I'm totally not wasting time playing hide-and-seek with the U-boats!",
