	main = "*sniffle*... I won't cause trouble on my adventures anymore, I promise! Huh? Just by adventuring, I'm already causing trouble? I-I didn't know that!|Now that I'm trying it, I think I'm really good at making candy! It's just that the pot is a little burnt, there's syrup everywhere, and the strawberries are a bit mushy...|Come to think of it, what if I replaced some of the strawberries with chili peppers? Ack?! N-no, Commander, I wasn't thinking up a prank!",
