	feeling4 = "",
	lose = "",
	feeling1 = "",
	skill = "",
	upgrade = "",
	propose = "",
	feeling5 = "This red plum branch is for you, Commander. I pray that it brings you, peace, fortune, joy, and smooth sailing. Hopefully, the warmth of spring will return to us sooner as well.",
	main = "I've almost finished preparations for our New Year banquet. Will you join us for dinner on New Year's Eve?|Fei Yuen and Fu Po? Heehee, don't worry. I gave them an earful for knocking over your vase earlier~|I'd like to nudge that bottom-most lantern over a bit. Do you think you could help me, Commander? ...Putting up lanterns together during the New Year really does make the two of us feel like a family...",
