	skill = "",
	upgrade = "",
	propose = "",
	feeling5 = "",
	main = "\"Inaction saps the vigor of the mind\"... Who said that, again?|Jogging courses, fat-burning courses, rolling hills courses... Is it really this complicated? I'll just start with whichever seems the toughest.|If you feel stressed out, just let it all out on that sandbag over there. I can attest that it does wonders for the mood.",
