	skill = "",
	upgrade = "",
	propose = "",
	feeling5 = "",
	main = "I know you told me to rest when we take breaks, but... my, how should I put it... I'm really enjoying this work!|There's a dream I have from time to time... I dream of what it would be like to cruise freely about the sea, using only my divine powers to do so, though I as a ship do not deserve such freedom.|Com...mander. Commander. Is something the matter? You've been zoning out while looking at me. By the way, I require your assistance. Would you please come over here?",
