	upgrade = "",
	propose = "",
	feeling5 = "Well, it looks like I only have one service left for you. Ring this bell, and your personal magical maid will come with pudding, hot milk, and a blanket in hand to give you lots of love!",
	main = "Milk, or kisses? Which warmth do you crave right now... Commander?|Which service would you like next? Pudding? Hot milk? A sweet little bedtime story? Or maybe you'd just like me to stay by your side... In that case, I'd feel like I was the pampered one!|Drink slowly so you don't choke, okay? It's okay... As long as I'm around, time will slow down for you, Commander.",
