	main = "Check my parachute buckle, won't you, Commaaander? Ahah♥ The touch of your fingertips... I think I'm going to start sweating again♥|Will you hold my hand, Commaaander? No, it's just to make sure we're safe before we jump... but I got my hopes a little too high, and now my palms are all damp♥|The wind's really blowing... If I lose my balance, I might just jump into your arms♥|Hehehe, I chose this outfit to be nice and cool... but I'm still sweating so much... Haaah, haaah... It's so hot...♥",
