	home = "Back again, are you? Oh, sweet hero... Heehee, do you long for me so?",
	unlock = "Oh sweet hero, you who charged into this forbidden and dangerous castle alone for the sake of your beloved angel... What a scene you've arrived to. The power of potions is really something, isn't it...",
