	feeling5 = "I've been racking my brain over the heroine of this manga for a while now... Now that I've spent so much time with you, I think I've gotten a rough idea. I think I've captured that sense of... endearingness? Haha, what am I even saying...",
	main = "This outfit might be kind of lame, but I'm not brave enough to be in my swimsuit ALL the time...|There are goddesses all over the place at this port! Heh heh heh... I think I've found heaven, after all!|Someone invited me out to lunch just a minute ago... I can't go in there! It's so dazzling, I doubt I could get a word out!",
