	skill = "",
	upgrade = "",
	propose = "",
	feeling5 = "",
	main = "I think... I'd prefer relaxing by the mountainside to playing by the water...|If I get a tan while wearing this outfit, it's going to leave behind imprints of my swimsuit... \"But that's what makes it good?\" Oh, um... I see...|I feel my body get hotter than usual... when someone stares at me so intently...|Miss Akashi, it's very thoughtful of you to bring drinks out for me, but... aren't these prices a bit excessive?|I am quite experienced with water-manipulating skills as part of my shinobi training, but not quite to the level of mastery as Reno and the others...",
