	drop_descrip = "What do you think about my swimsuit? As long as you like it, that's all that matters. It is a masterpiece that incorporates the opinions of many different shipgirls. During that time, I was advised that it would be better for it to include *** and ***, but I reluctantly excluded them due to my high levels of situational awareness.",
