	main = "The size is mismatched? Not at all, it is a perfect fit. This is a masterpiece that carefully takes into consideration many factors such as skin exposure ratio.|The sun is quite intense. Should I apply sunscreen, or deliberately work up some tan lines? Quite the dilemma.|The goddess of allure... is born. Hmm? Is \"goddess\" a bit much? Indeed, I am no goddess, but rather a Spirit. However, I do not intend to change the \"allure\" part.",
