	lose = "",
	feeling1 = "",
	skill = "",
	upgrade = "",
	propose = "",
	feeling5 = "",
	main = "\"Nyuhuhu... Yoshinon prepared this legendary swimsuit!\" Miss Akashi was the one who provided it...but what do you mean by...\"legendary\"?|\"Woah! What a vast ocean! And so many fish! I've been looking forward to this!\" I think I...might be a little excited too...? But maybe...also a bit scared?|Before going to the beach...I built myself...a little place to stay. \"This is the very definition of a secret base, isn't it?!\"",
