	main = "Come on, Cheshire! Stop messing around and gimme a hand! You too, Georgia! Chop-chop!|Bremerton's a real cool gal! You should totally hit her up if you need life advice or if you run into trouble at the party!|Boy, I tell ya, I just love the beach! We gotta work extra hard so everyone can have a good time here!",
